#: ../../migrate-v1.md:1
msgid "从 v1 迁移数据"
msgstr "Migrating data from v1"

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:3
msgid ""
"v1 的数据在 Redis 里（`picbed:*` 键），文件在你那台 v1 部署的 `src/static/upload` 目录下 （v1 "
"代码已从本仓库移除，看旧版本用 git tag）。`tools/migrate_v1_to_v2.py` 把它们写进 v2 的 关系库与存储后端。"
msgstr ""
"v1 kept its data in Redis (`picbed:*` keys) and its files under "
"`src/static/upload` of the v1 deployment (the v1 sources are no longer in "
"this repository; check the git tags for old versions). "
"`tools/migrate_v1_to_v2.py` writes both into the v2 relational database and"
" storage backends."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:7
msgid "只迁数据、不含 v2 自身的升级流程：拉代码 → 装依赖 → 重建前端 → 重启，见[部署与运维](deploy.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This page only covers the data, not the v2 upgrade itself — pull the code, "
"install dependencies, rebuild the front end and restart, as described in "
"[Deployment and operations](deploy.md)."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:9
msgid "基本用法"
msgstr "Basic usage"

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:23
msgid ""
"v1 只用云存储（又拍云 / 七牛）时**没有本地目录，直接省略 `--v1-upload-dir`**：图片从 bucket "
"采纳、字节确实丢了的登记成外链，**不会**被跳过——`--skip-images` 是「只迁用户与相册」， 两者不是一回事。"
msgstr ""
"If v1 used cloud storage only (Upyun / Qiniu) there is **no local "
"directory, so omit `--v1-upload-dir`**: images are adopted from the bucket,"
" and rows whose bytes are really gone become external links. They are "
"**not** skipped — `--skip-images` means users and albums only, which is a "
"different thing."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:27
msgid ""
"用镜像部署时可以不开宿主机环境，直接在容器里跑（`tools/` 已打进镜像，工作目录就是 `/app`； `redis-py` "
"不在运行时依赖里，临时装一次即可）："
msgstr ""
"With the container image you can run it inside the container instead of on "
"the host (`tools/` is baked into the image and the working directory is "
"`/app`; `redis-py` is not a runtime dependency, install it once for this "
"run):"

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:36
msgid ""
"`--v1-upload-dir` 指向 v1 的目录，需要 `-v "
"/srv/sapic-v1/src/static/upload:/v1-upload:ro` 把它挂进来；库与 `STORAGE_DIR` 走 "
"compose 里的环境变量与数据卷。"
msgstr ""
"`--v1-upload-dir` points at the v1 directory, so mount it with `-v "
"/srv/sapic-v1/src/static/upload:/v1-upload:ro`. The database and "
"`STORAGE_DIR` come from the compose environment and data volume."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:39
msgid "行为与规则"
msgstr "Behaviour and rules"

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:41
msgid "**幂等**：用户按 `username`、相册按 `(owner, name)`、图片按 `sha` 去重，中断后直接重跑，只补缺的部分。"
msgstr ""
"**Idempotent**: users are deduplicated by `username`, albums by `(owner, "
"name)` and images by `sha`, so an interrupted run can simply be started "
"again and only the missing parts are filled in."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:42
msgid "**sha 不变**：迁移保留 v1 的 `sha`，已发布的 `/raw/<sha>` 与直链继续有效。"
msgstr ""
"**SHAs are preserved**: the migration keeps v1 `sha` values, so published "
"`/raw/<sha>` URLs and direct links keep working."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:43
msgid ""
"**文件走存储驱动**：原文件重新写进当前主后端（默认 `up2local` 的 `STORAGE_DIR`），不是简单搬目录； "
"文件已丢失的图片会登记为外链（`source_url` 指向 v1 的 `src`），不会被丢弃。"
msgstr ""
"**Files go through the storage driver**: the original bytes are written to "
"the current primary backend (the `STORAGE_DIR` of `up2local` by default) "
"rather than moving a directory around. Images whose bytes are lost are "
"registered as external links (`source_url` pointing at the v1 `src`) "
"instead of being dropped."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:45
msgid ""
"**v1 存在云存储（又拍云/七牛）时不会变成外链**：只要图片的 `src` 就在主后端的公开域名下， 脚本直接把 bucket 里已有的对象登记成"
" `ok` 副本（`images_adopted`），不下载、不重传， 删除时也会真正删掉对象；v1 的域名和现在配的不一样时，用 `--v1"
"-src-prefix https://旧域名` 告诉脚本按哪个前缀还原对象路径。"
msgstr ""
"**Cloud-stored v1 images do not become external links**: as long as an "
"image `src` is already under the public domain of the primary backend, the "
"script registers the existing bucket object as an `ok` replica "
"(`images_adopted`) without downloading or re-uploading, and deletion still "
"removes the object. When the v1 domain differs from the current one, pass "
"`--v1-src-prefix https://old-domain` so the script can rebuild object keys."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:49
msgid ""
"**已经按旧版本迁过一遍、图片都成了外链**：不用清库重来——确认后端配好加速域名后， 带着 `--refresh-external` 再跑一次，会把"
" `source_url` 的外链行就地补成 `ok` 副本（`images_adopted`）。"
msgstr ""
"**Already migrated with an older build and every image is an external "
"link?** No need to wipe the database: once the backend has an acceleration "
"domain, re-run with `--refresh-external` and those `source_url` rows are "
"converted in place into `ok` replicas (`images_adopted`)."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:51
msgid ""
"**大小 / 类型 / 尺寸不再未知**：v1 把上传时的存储返回存在 `senders` 里（字节数在 `file-size`， 有些版本只记 "
"HTTP 的 `content-length`；另有 `width`/`height`/`content-md5`），脚本据此填 "
"`size`/`mime`/`width`/`height` 和副本 `etag`；早期跑出来 `0 B / 未知类型 / 未知` 的行， 用 "
"`--refresh-external` 重跑即可补齐（不需要重新上传）。"
msgstr ""
"**Size / type / dimensions are no longer unknown**: v1 stored the storage "
"response under `senders` (bytes under `file-size`, sometimes only the HTTP "
"`content-length`; plus `width`/`height`/`content-md5`), which the script "
"uses to fill `size`/`mime`/`width`/`height` and the replica `etag`. Rows "
"that an early run left as `0 B / unknown type / unknown` are fixed by re-"
"running with `--refresh-external` — no re-upload needed."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:55
msgid ""
"**可见性**：v1 没有可见性概念、图片都是免登录直链，所以迁移出的相册与图片默认 `public`； 需要收紧用 `--visibility "
"private`（会同时改相册与图片，老直链随即失效）。"
msgstr ""
"**Visibility**: v1 had no visibility concept and every image was a public "
"direct link, so migrated albums and images default to `public`. Pass "
"`--visibility private` to tighten them (albums and images change together, "
"and old direct links stop working)."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:57
msgid ""
"其余参数：`--only-user alice`、`--limit 100`、`--v2-db-url`、`--v2-storage-dir`； "
"`--skip-images`（只迁用户与相册）、`--skip-users`（只迁图片）。"
msgstr ""
"Other options: `--only-user alice`, `--limit 100`, `--v2-db-url`, `--v2"
"-storage-dir`, `--skip-images` (users and albums only), `--skip-users` "
"(images only)."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:59
msgid ""
"**依赖**：数据库驱动复用应用依赖——PostgreSQL 走 `psycopg`（v3）、MySQL 走 `PyMySQL`，都在 "
"`server/requirements/base.txt` 里；工具没有单独的 requirements 文件，直接用仓库 `.venv` 运行。"
msgstr ""
"**Dependencies**: the database drivers reuse the application requirements —"
" `psycopg` (v3) for PostgreSQL and `PyMySQL` for MySQL, both in "
"`server/requirements/base.txt`. The tool has no separate requirements file;"
" run it with the repository `.venv`."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:61
msgid ""
"**redis-py 要单独装**：v2 应用不再依赖 Redis，只有这个工具要读 v1 的 `picbed:*` 键， 现装的虚拟环境里没有就先 "
"`pip install redis`（`server/requirements/dev.txt` 里有）。"
msgstr ""
"**redis-py must be installed separately**: v2 does not depend on Redis, "
"only this tool reads the v1 `picbed:*` keys. If your virtualenv lacks it, "
"run `pip install redis` (`server/requirements/dev.txt` includes it)."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:63
msgid "`--redis-url` 必填，`--v2-db-url` 省略时才用配置里的 `DATABASE_URL`。"
msgstr ""
"`--redis-url` is required; `--v2-db-url` only falls back to the configured "
"`DATABASE_URL` when omitted."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:64
msgid "有失败项时退出码为 `1`，清单里给出 sha 与原因；修复后重跑即可。"
msgstr ""
"Any failure sets the exit code to `1` and the report lists the sha and the "
"reason; fix and re-run."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:65
msgid "迁移前先停 v1 写入（或只读挂载 Redis），避免迁移期间新增图片没有进入快照。"
msgstr ""
"Stop v1 writes first (or mount Redis read-only) so images added during the "
"migration are not missing from the snapshot."

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:67
msgid "客户端要改一次配置"
msgstr "Clients need a one-time change"

#: ../../migrate-v1.md:69
msgid ""
"v1 的 `POST /api/upload` 兼容端点已移除，上传统一为 `POST /api/v2/upload` + 访问令牌（PAT）。 "
"PicGo / uPic / Typora / 右键菜单 / 油猴脚本的逐项配置见[快捷上传](usage.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The v1 `POST /api/upload` compatibility endpoint is gone; uploads are "
"always `POST /api/v2/upload` with an access token (PAT). Per-client setup "
"for PicGo / uPic / Typora / the context menu / the userscript is in [Quick "
"upload](usage.md)."

